sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Guardian / Student
  participant Web as Web Frontend (/pay)
  participant API as Payments API (/payments/checkout)
  participant Gateway as Payment Gateway (SSLCommerz / bKash)
  participant Webhook as Webhook Controller
  participant Ledger as Double-Entry Ledger Service
  participant Escrow as Escrow Hold Pool

  User->>Web: Select payment method & click Pay
  Web->>API: POST /api/v1/payments/checkout (bookingId, amount)
  API->>Gateway: Initialize payment session
  Gateway-->>API: Return transaction URL
  API-->>Web: Redirect to secure payment gateway
  Web->>Gateway: Customer completes OTP / PIN authentication
  Gateway->>Webhook: POST /api/v1/payments/webhook (verified signature)
  
  activate Webhook
  Webhook->>Webhook: Verify SHA256 signature & amount match
  Webhook->>API: Mark payment_order as succeeded
  Webhook->>Ledger: Post balanced double-entry journal
  Note over Ledger: DR: Gateway Receivable Account<br/>CR: Customer Escrow Liability Account
  Webhook->>Escrow: Create Escrow Hold record (status: held)
  Webhook-->>Gateway: HTTP 200 OK
  deactivate Webhook

  Note over User, Escrow: Tutoring sessions conducted & verified
  API->>Escrow: Milestone session completed & confirmed
  API->>Ledger: Post milestone disbursement journal
  Note over Ledger: DR: Customer Escrow Liability Account<br/>CR: Tutor Payable Account<br/>CR: Platform Revenue (Commission BPS)
  API->>Escrow: Release milestone funds to Tutor Balance
